The farm can be expanded from [[experience]] level 22 and up by unlocking farm plots. Players need the same number of [[Land Deed|land deeds]], [[mallet]]s and [[Marker Stake|marker stakes]] to unlock one plot but this number may vary from one plot to another.

Expansions are in two locations: the main one is on the side of the farmhouse; the second one is across the main road.

The second location also has special plots with exclusive [[decorations]]. Unlocking these requires [[Expansion Permit|expansion permits]], which are unlocked at level 29.

All plots can be unlocked starting at the top. Once a section has been unlocked all adjacent ones become unlockable.

See the maps and tables below to know how many objects are needed for each plot.
